<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
 <meta charset="UTF-8">
 <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
 <title>Yulla Kanda Adventures</title>
 <style>
 * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
 body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
 header { background: #1b4f72; color: #fff; padding: 1rem; text-align: center; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
 nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
 .nav-links { list-style: none; display: flex; gap: 15px; }
 .nav-links a { color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; }
 .hero { background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544198365-f8d68967da07?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80') no-repeat center center/cover; color: #fff; text-align: center; padding: 100px 20px; }
 .hero h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
 section { padding: 20px; }
 .section-title { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 1.8rem; color: #1b4f72; }
 .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }
 .card { background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
 .card img { width: 100%; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; }
 .card-content { padding: 15px; }
 .card-content h3 { margin-bottom: 10px; }
 .price { font-weight: bold; color: #d35400; font-size: 1.2rem; display: block; margin-top: 10px; }
 .btn { display: inline-block; background: #d35400; color: #fff; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 5px; text-decoration: none; text-align: center; width: 100%; font-weight: bold; }
 form { background: #f4f4f4; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; }
 form input, form textarea, form select { width: 100%; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 5px; }
 .faq-item { background: #f8f9fa; margin-bottom: 15px; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #1b4f72; }
 .faq-item h3 { margin-bottom: 5px; color: #1b4f72; }
 .contact-info { text-align: center; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 1.2rem; color: #1b4f72; font-weight: bold; }
 footer { background: #2c3e50; color: #fff; text-align: center; padding: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
 @media (min-width: 768px) {
 .grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
 }
 </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
 <nav>
 <div class="logo"><strong>Yulla Kanda Adventures</strong></div>
 <ul class="nav-links">
 <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
 <li><a href="#destinations">Destinations</a></li>
 <li><a href="#packages">Packages</a></li>
 <li><a href="#reviews">Reviews</a></li>
 <li><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></li>
 <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
 </ul>
 </nav>
</header>

<div class="hero">
 <h1>Explore Yulla Kanda</h1>
 <p>Trek to the world's highest Krishna Temple in the heart of Himachal Pradesh.</p>
</div>

<section id="about">
 <h2 class="section-title">Welcome to Yulla Kanda</h2>
 <div class="card">
 <div class="card-content">
 <h3>Discover the Mystical Himalayas</h3>
 <p>Experience the divine beauty of Yulla Kanda, home to the world's highest Lord Krishna Temple located beside a pristine glacial lake at nearly 3,900 meters. Our community offers authentic Pahadi hospitality through traditional Yulla homestays, where you can immerse yourself in local Kinnauri culture and traditions. Embark on a breathtaking trekking journey through dense pine forests and alpine meadows, perfectly blending spiritual pilgrimage with thrilling high-altitude adventure.</p>
 </div>
 </div>
</section>

<section id="destinations" style="background: #eef2f3;">
 <h2 class="section-title">Our Adventures & Destinations</h2>
 <div class="grid">
 <div class="card">
 <img src="https://i.supaimg.com/7e726bf4-e089-4c23-8a90-c09ecb01d07b/140aa031-5917-4b39-93d6-48f6dc3beddb.jpg?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" alt="Shrikhand Mahadev">
 <div class="card-content">
 <h3>Shrikhand Mahadev</h3>
 <p>A challenging pilgrimage trek leading to a revered natural rock Shivling amidst stunning high-altitude landscapes.</p>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="card">
 <img src="https://i.supaimg.com/7e726bf4-e089-4c23-8a90-c09ecb01d07b/7d53f621-8bab-4815-abfa-364671056978.jpg?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" alt="Yulla Kanda">
 <div class="card-content">
 <h3>Yulla Kanda</h3>
 <p>A sacred high-altitude glacial lake housing the world's highest Lord Krishna Temple, surrounded by lush alpine meadows.</p>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="card">
 <img src="https://i.supaimg.com/7e726bf4-e089-4c23-8a90-c09ecb01d07b/b2a41cc4-8411-470b-a7da-702b542665d2.jpg?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" alt="Kinner Kailash">
 <div class="card-content">
 <h3>Kinner Kailash</h3>
 <p>The majestic abode of Lord Shiva, offering awe-inspiring views of towering snow-capped peaks and rugged terrain.</p>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="card">
 <img src=https://i.supaimg.com/7e726bf4-e089-4c23-8a90-c09ecb01d07b/de1e32e5-18b4-4fb7-beda-369c79c72f92.jpg?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" alt="Kalpa">
 <div class="card-content">
 <h3>Kalpa</h3>
 <p>A serene village known for its apple orchards and panoramic vistas of the spectacular Kinner Kailash range.</p>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="card">
 <img src=https://i.supaimg.com/7e726bf4-e089-4c23-8a90-c09ecb01d07b/df5eb7df-6783-4156-b380-ceb56043f23d.jpg?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" alt="Bhimakali Temple">
 <div class="card-content">
 <h3>Bhimakali Temple</h3>
 <p>An architecturally magnificent temple in Sarahan, blending Hindu and Buddhist styles with deep historical roots.</p>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="card">
 <img src="https://i.supaimg.com/7e726bf4-e089-4c23-8a90-c09ecb01d07b/eb193cdf-bfd5-456f-af95-c99a030498a3.jpg?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" alt="Mandi Temples">
 <div class="card-content">
 <h3>Mandi Temples</h3>
 <p>Explore the historic temple town of Mandi, often called the Varanasi of the Hills, situated along the Beas River.or karsog village views and temples Explore all over mandi</p>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="card">
 <img src="https://i.supaimg.com/7e726bf4-e089-4c23-8a90-c09ecb01d07b/5eb89cb5-d002-41db-8a69-6dc2084c4706.jpg?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" alt="Shikari Mata Temple">
 <div class="card-content">
 <h3>Shikari Mata Temple</h3>
 <p>A unique open-air mountaintop temple offering breathtaking 360-degree views of the surrounding ranges.</p>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
</section>

<section id="packages">
 <h2 class="section-title">Our Trekking Packages</h2>
 <div class="grid">
 <div class="card">
 <img src="https://i.supaimg.com/7e726bf4-e089-4c23-8a90-c09ecb01d07b/7d53f621-8bab-4815-abfa-364671056978.jpg?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" alt="Yulla Kanda Lake">
 <div class="card-content">
 <h3>Yulla Kanda Sacred Trek</h3>
 <p>A 2 night  3 day spiritual and adventurous journey through dense forests and alpine meadows to the mystical glacial lake housing the Krishna Temple.</p>
 <span class="price">Price: ₹8,000 per person with guide and pickup shimla to shimla </span>
