 </div>
 </div>
</section>
<div class="card">
 <img src="https://i.supaimg.com/7e726bf4-e089-4c23-8a90-c09ecb01d07b/76bc45aa-c65f-4b6a-bc3b-1e318934e958.jpg?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" alt="Bhimakali Temple">
 <div class="card-content">
 <h3>Kinner Kailash </h3>
