 <h2 class="section-title">Trekkers' Experiences & Reviews</h2>
 <div class="grid">
 <div class="card">
 <img src="https://i.supaimg.com/7e726bf4-e089-4c23-8a90-c09ecb01d07b/5b65722f-50f0-454c-a565-1c986022ded7.jpg?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" alt="Trek Review 1">
